review logistics from Malvern East and respond promptly.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- FINAL CTA BANNER -->\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 3.5rem;background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1628 0%, #162a45 60%, #0d283e 100%);border-radius: 16px;padding: 3rem 2rem;text-align: center;color: #ffffff\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.85rem;color: #ffffff;font-weight: 800;margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0\">Ready for an Itemized Cleaning Quote?</h3>\n            <p style=\"color: #cbd5e1;font-size: 1.05rem;margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;max-width: 550px\">\n                Calculate an indicative price in seconds with our multi-step estimator or contact our team directly.\n            </p>\n            <div style=\"display: flex;gap: 1rem;justify-content: center;flex-wrap: wrap\">\n                <a href=\"http://prime-cleaning-service.local/get-a-quote/\" class=\"pce-btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 0.9rem 2rem\">Get an Estimate Online &rarr;</a>\n                <a href=\"http://prime-cleaning-service.local/contact/\" class=\"pce-btn-secondary\" style=\"color: #ffffff !important;padding: 0.9rem 2rem\">Contact Details</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-11-07 12:41:40','2026-11-07 12:41:40','',0,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/home/',0,'page','',0),(7,0,'2026-11-07 11:52:05','2026-11-07 11:52:05','\n<div style=\"max-width: 1100px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 2.5rem 1rem\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: center;max-width: 720px;margin: 0 auto 3rem\">\n        <span class=\"pce-badge\">Service Directory</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-size: 2.75rem;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: -0.03em;margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Comprehensive Cleaning Solutions</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.15rem;color: #64748b;line-height: 1.6\">\n            Systematic domestic maintenance, intensive detail cleans, bond vacate handovers, and commercial office cleaning across Melbourne.\n        </p