   We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. Customer records are stored securely within our authenticated administrative systems and accessed only by authorised personnel for operational purposes.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color: #1e3a5f\">4. Payment Security</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #475569;line-height: 1.6\">\n        This demonstration website does not process online credit card payments or retain banking credentials. Payment arrangements are confirmed directly with clients upon agreement of services.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color: #1e3a5f\">5. Contact Regarding Privacy</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #475569;line-height: 1.6\">\n        For queries concerning personal information handling or to request updates to your records, please contact:\n        <br>\n        <strong>Prime Domestic &amp; Cleaning Services</strong><br>\n        Base: Malvern East VIC 3145<br>\n        Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@example.com\">info@example.com (Demo placeholder)</a>\n    </p>\n</div>\n','Privacy Policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','3-revision-v1','','','2026-11-07 11:52:05','2026-11-07 11:52:05','',3,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/?p=15',0,'revision','',0),(21,0,'2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026-11-07 12:31:21',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','21','','','2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026-11-07 12:31:21','',0,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/21/',0,'nav_menu_item','',0),(22,0,'2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026-11-07 12:31:21',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','22','','','2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026-11-07 12:31:21','',0,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/22/',2,'nav_menu_item','',0),(23,0,'2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026-11-07 12:31:21',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','23','','','2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026-11-07 12:31:21','',7,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/23/',3,'nav_menu_item','',0),(24,0,'2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026-11-07 12:31:21',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','24','','','2026-11-07 12:31:21','2026