#7e22ce;font-size:0.95rem\">Hourly Rate AUD</span>\n                <a href=\"http://prime-cleaning-service.local/services/office-cleaning/\" style=\"color:#7e22ce;font-weight:700;font-size:0.92rem;text-decoration:none\">View Scope &rarr;</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"4.5rem\",\"bottom\":\"4.5rem\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"background\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"background: #f1f5f9;padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem;border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1060px;margin: 0 auto\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 3.5rem\">\n            <span class=\"pce-badge\">Transparent Workflow</span>\n            <h2 style=\"font-size: 2.35rem;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: -0.025em;margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">How It Works &mdash; Simple, Fast, Transparent</h2>\n            <p style=\"color: #64748b;font-size: 1.05rem\">From online calculation to a spotless handover in three transparent steps.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap: 2rem\">\n            <!-- Step 1 -->\n            <div style=\"background: #ffffff;border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius: 14px;padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;position: relative\">\n                <div style=\"width: 48px;height: 48px;border-radius: 12px;background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d9488 0%, #0f766e 100%);color: #fff;font-size: 1.35rem;font-weight: 800;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: center;margin-bottom: 1.25rem\">1</div>\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem;color: #0f172a;margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">1. Instant Calculation</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #64748b;font-size: 0.95rem;line-height: 1.6;margin: 0\">\n                    Select your service, room count, and frequency in our 5-step estimator. Review an itemized breakdown wit