: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius: 12px;padding: 1.75rem;margin-bottom: 1.25rem\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.12rem;color: #0f172a;margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0\">Are the online estimates guaranteed fixed quotes?</h3>\n            <p style=\"color: #64748b;font-size: 0.95rem;margin: 0;line-height: 1.6\">Estimates generated by our calculator represent indicative figures based on standard room sizes and configured demo rates. Final quotes are confirmed once exact property condition, access, and special requests are verified with you.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff;border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius: 12px;padding: 1.75rem;margin-bottom: 1.25rem\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.12rem;color: #0f172a;margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0\">Do you supply equipment and cleaning chemicals?</h3>\n            <p style=\"color: #64748b;font-size: 0.95rem;margin: 0;line-height: 1.6\">Yes, commercial-grade equipment, microfibre systems, and effective cleaning agents can be fully provided. Alternatively, we are happy to use your preferred eco-friendly products if requested.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff;border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius: 12px;padding: 1.75rem;margin-bottom: 1.25rem\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.12rem;color: #0f172a;margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0\">What happens if my postcode is outside the sample prefix list?</h3>\n            <p style=\"color: #64748b;font-size: 0.95rem;margin: 0;line-height: 1.6\">The estimator will recognize that your postcode is outside standard demo prefixes (314*, 315*) and will immediately offer a manual quotation request path. We will review logistics from Malvern East and respond promptly.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- FINAL CTA BANNER -->\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 3.5rem;background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1628 0%, #162a45 60%, #0d283e 100%);border-radius: 16px;padding: 3rem 2rem;text-align: center;color: #ffffff\">\n            <h3 style=\"fon