ight: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li>Benchtops &amp; splashbacks wiped and degreased</li>\n                    <li>Cooktop, burner rings &amp; rangehood exterior wiped</li>\n                    <li>Sink, drainage &amp; tapware descaled and polished</li>\n                    <li>Microwave interior and exterior cleaned</li>\n                    <li>Fridge &amp; dishwasher exterior doors wiped</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bathrooms -->\n            <div class=\"pce-card\">\n                <div style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;gap: 0.5rem;margin-bottom: 1rem\">\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem\">🚿</span>\n                    <h3 style=\"color: #0f766e;font-size: 1.2rem;margin: 0\">Bathrooms &amp; Toilets</h3>\n                </div>\n                <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li>Shower screens &amp; tiles scrubbed and dried</li>\n                    <li>Bath tub, vanity basins &amp; bench sanitised</li>\n                    <li>Toilets thoroughly disinfected (bowl, rim, seat)</li>\n                    <li>Mirrors polished streak-free</li>\n                    <li>Towel rails and chrome fittings buffed</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Living &amp; Bedrooms -->\n            <div class=\"pce-card\">\n                <div style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;gap: 0.5rem;margin-bottom: 1rem\">\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem\">🛋️</span>\n                    <h3 style=\"color: #0f766e;font-size: 1.2rem;margin: 0\">Living, Dining &amp; Beds</h3>\n                </div>\n                <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li>Accessible furniture, shelves &amp; skirting dusted</li>\n                    <li>Neat linen arrangement upon request</li>\n                    <li>Carpets, rugs &amp; runners vacuumed thoroughly</li>\n                    <li>Hard flooring damp-mopped with pH-neutral soap</li>\n                    <li>Bins emptied, relined and tidy presentation</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Savings &amp; Schedule Banner -->\n    <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d9488 0%, #0f766e 100%);border-radius: 16px;padding: 2.25rem 2rem;color: #ffffff;margin-bottom: 3rem\">\n        <div style=\"display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap: 1.5rem;align-items: center\">\n            <div>\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;color: #ffffff;font-weight: 800;margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0\">Recurring Schedule Discounts</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #ccfbf1;font-size: 0.95rem;line-height: 1.5;margin: 0\">\n                    Lock in predictable cleaning care and enjoy automated savings on every visit:\n                </p>\n                <div style=\"display: flex;gap: 1rem;margin-top: 1rem;flex-wrap: wrap\">\n                    <div style=\"padding: 0.5rem 1rem;border-radius: 8px;font-weight: 700\">\n                        Weekly Service: 15% OFF\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"padding: 0.5rem 1rem;border-radius: 8px;font-weight: 700\">\n                        Fortnightly Service: 10% OFF\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: right\">\n                <a href=\"http://prime-cleaning-service.local/get-a-quote/\" class=\"pce-btn-secondary\" style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#0f766e !important;border:none;padding: 0.9rem 2rem\">\n                    Calculate Regular Clean &rarr;\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n','Regular Home Cleaning','','inherit','closed','closed','','8-revision-v1','','','2026-11-07 12:56:17','2026-11-07 12:56:17','',8,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/?p=34',0,'revision','',0),(35,0,'2026-11-07 12:56:17','2026-11-07 12:56:17','\n<div style=\"max-width: 960px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 2.5rem 1rem\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: center;max-width: 700px;margin: 0 auto 3rem\">\n        <span class=\"pce-badge\" style=\"background:#e0f2fe;color:#0369a1\">Intensive Detail</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-size: 2.75rem;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: -0.03em;margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Deep Cleaning Service</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.15rem;color: #64748b;line-height: 1.6\">\n            A rigorous top-to-bottom clean restoring built-up grime, soap scum, and neglected surfaces.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pce-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: 2.5rem\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #0f172a;font-size: 1.4rem;margin-top: 0\">When is a Deep Clean Needed?</h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 1rem;line-height: 1.65\">\n            Routine cleaning addresses everyday maintenance, but over months, dust, mineral limescale, grease film, and scuffs accumulate in less visible zones. Our deep cleaning is recommended once or twice annually, after home renovations, before hosting guests, or when setting an immaculate standard for ongoing service.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Inclusions Grid -->\n    <div class=\"pce-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3rem\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: #0f172a;font-size: 1.3rem;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 1.25rem\">Deep Cleaning Inclusions (Above &amp; Beyond Regular Cleaning):</h3>\n        <div style=\"display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap: 1.5rem\">\n            <div>\n                <ul style=\"color: #334155;font-size: 0.95rem;line-height: 1.75;padding-left: 1.25rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li><strong>Skirting Boards &amp; Trims:</strong> Every room’s skirting boards, door frames, and architraves individually wiped down by hand.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Bathroom Limescale &amp; Grout:</strong> Targeted descaling on shower glass, ceramic wall tiles, and stubborn tap calcification.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Kitchen Degreasing:</strong> Rangehood filter immersion degrease, splashback grease breakdown, and exterior appliance buffing.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <ul style=\"color: #334155;font-size: 0.95rem;line-height: 1.75;padding-left: 1.25rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li><strong>Behind &amp; Underneath:</strong> Accessible furniture, freestanding laundry appliances, and corners moved and detailed.</li>\n                    <li><strong>High &amp; Low Points:</strong> Ceiling fans, air conditioning vent covers, high window sills, and curtain pelmets dusted.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Marks &amp; Fingerprints:</strong> Spot mark cleaning on interior painted plaster walls around switches and high-traffic doors.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: center;padding: 2.5rem;background: #f8fafc;border-radius: 16px;border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem;color: #0f172a;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0.75rem\">Get an Instant Indicative Deep Clean Price</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #64748b;font-size: 1rem;margin-bottom: 1.5rem\">Our estimator calculates deep cleaning instantly based on your bedroom and bathroom count.</p>\n        <a href=\"http://prime-cleaning-service.local/get-a-quote/\" class=\"pce-btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 0.95rem 2.25rem\">Estimate Deep Cleaning Now &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n','Deep Cleaning','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-07 12:56:17','2026-11-07 12:56:17','',9,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/?p=35',0,'revision','',0),(36,0,'2026-11-07 12:56:18','2026-11-07 12:56:18','\n<div style=\"max-width: 960px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 2.5rem 1rem\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: center;max-width: 700px;margin: 0 auto 3rem\">\n        <span class=\"pce-badge\" style=\"background:#ffedd5;color:#c2410c\">Tenancy Bond Inspection</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-size: 2.75rem;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: -0.03em;margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">End-of-Lease Vacate Cleaning</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.15rem;color: #64748b;line-height: 1.6\">\n            Thorough vacate cleaning aligned with Melbourne real estate property manager checklists.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pce-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: 2.5rem\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #0f172a;font-size: 1.4rem;margin-top: 0\">Securing Your Rental Handover</h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 1rem;line-height: 1.65;margin: 0\">\n            Moving out is stressful enough without agonizing over tenancy exit condition reports. Prime Domestic delivers exhaustive end-of-lease vacate cleans tailored to the expectations of Melbourne leasing agents, property managers, and landlords.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Vacate Checklist -->\n    <div class=\"pce-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: 2.5rem\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: #0f172a;font-size: 1.3rem;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 1.25rem\">Comprehensive Agent Vacate Checklist</h3>\n        <div style=\"display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap: 1.75rem\">\n            <div>\n                <h4 style=\"color: #c2410c;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Kitchen &amp; Oven Focus</h4>\n                <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li><strong>Oven Interior:</strong> Racks, trays, fan cover &amp; door glass degreased</li>\n                    <li><strong>Rangehood:</strong> Filters soaked and degreased, exterior polished</li>\n                    <li><strong>Cabinetry:</strong> All cupboards &amp; drawers wiped inside and out</li>\n                    <li><strong>Surfaces:</strong> Benches, splashbacks, sink &amp; tapware buffed</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 style=\"color: #c2410c;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Bathrooms &amp; Laundry</h4>\n                <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li><strong>Showers:</strong> Shower screens descaled of mineral film, grout scrubbed</li>\n                    <li><strong>Vanities &amp; Toilets:</strong> Mirrored cabinets, sinks &amp; toilets disinfected</li>\n                    <li><strong>Exhaust Fans:</strong> Grilles removed and vacuumed of lint</li>\n                    <li><strong>Laundry Tub:</strong> Washed and polished, surrounding tiles degreased</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 style=\"color: #c2410c;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Windows, Walls &amp; Skirtings</h4>\n                <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                    <li><strong>Window Glass &amp; Tracks:</strong> Internal panes wiped, tracks vacuumed</li>\n                    <li><strong>Doors &amp; Skirtings:</strong> All skirting boards and door frames hand-wiped</li>\n                    <li><strong>Wall Spot Cleaning:</strong> Noticeable scuffs and marks treated</li>\n                    <li><strong>Floors:</strong> Edge-to-edge vacuuming and wet hard floor scrubbing</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Handover Tip -->\n    <div style=\"background: #fff7ed;border-left: 4px solid #f97316;padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;border-radius: 8px;margin-bottom: 3rem\">\n        <strong style=\"color: #9a3412;font-size: 1rem;display:block;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">Tenancy Vacate Pre-requisites:</strong>\n        <span style=\"color: #7c2d12;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.55;display:block\">\n            For the most effective bond outcome, properties should be fully emptied of personal possessions before clean commences, with electrical power and hot water remaining active.\n        </span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: center\">\n        <a href=\"http://prime-cleaning-service.local/get-a-quote/\" class=\"pce-btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 0.95rem 2.25rem\">Estimate End-of-Lease Vacate Clean &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n','End-of-Lease Cleaning','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-11-07 12:56:18','2026-11-07 12:56:18','',10,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/?p=36',0,'revision','',0),(37,0,'2026-11-07 12:56:18','2026-11-07 12:56:18','\n<div style=\"max-width: 960px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 2.5rem 1rem\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: center;max-width: 700px;margin: 0 auto 3rem\">\n        <span class=\"pce-badge\" style=\"background:#f3e8ff;color:#7e22ce\">Workplace &amp; Commercial</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-size: 2.75rem;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: -0.03em;margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Commercial &amp; Office Cleaning</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.15rem;color: #64748b;line-height: 1.6\">\n            Professional workplace sanitisation tailored for Melbourne businesses, consultancies, and commercial suites.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pce-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: 2.5rem\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #0f172a;font-size: 1.4rem;margin-top: 0\">A Clean Workplace Inspires Confidence</h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 1rem;line-height: 1.65;margin: 0\">\n            A well-maintained office provides a healthy environment for staff and leaves a polished impression on visiting clients. We service consulting suites, creative agencies, medical rooms, and commercial offices with schedules tailored to your operations &mdash; whether early mornings, evenings, or weekends.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Commercial Scope Details -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr));gap: 1.75rem;margin-bottom: 3rem\">\n        <div class=\"pce-card\">\n            <h3 style=\"color: #7e22ce;font-size: 1.2rem;margin-top: 0\">Workstations &amp; Meeting Rooms</h3>\n            <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                <li>Desks &amp; collaboration tables wiped and sanitised</li>\n                <li>Monitors, phones &amp; touch points dusted</li>\n                <li>Boardroom tables polished and chairs arranged</li>\n                <li>Internal glass partitions &amp; entry doors buffed</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pce-card\">\n            <h3 style=\"color: #7e22ce;font-size: 1.2rem;margin-top: 0\">Kitchenette &amp; Amenities</h3>\n            <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                <li>Staff tea station, coffee machines &amp; benches wiped</li>\n                <li>Microwave interiors &amp; fridge exteriors cleaned</li>\n                <li>Dishwashers loaded, run, or emptied as required</li>\n                <li>Hand towel &amp; soap supplies restocked</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pce-card\">\n            <h3 style=\"color: #7e22ce;font-size: 1.2rem;margin-top: 0\">Washrooms &amp; Waste Disposal</h3>\n            <ul style=\"color: #475569;font-size: 0.92rem;line-height: 1.7;padding-left: 1.15rem;margin: 0\">\n                <li>Commercial washrooms scrubbed &amp; disinfected</li>\n                <li>Toilet paper, soap &amp; paper towel dispensers replenished</li>\n                <li>Workstation waste &amp; recycling bins emptied daily</li>\n                <li>Bin liners replaced and rubbish taken to central bins</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Hourly Calculation Clarity -->\n    <div style=\"background: #f8fafc;border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius: 16px;padding: 2.25rem 2rem;margin-bottom: 3rem\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem;color: #0f172a;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0.75rem\">Transparent Hourly Pricing (AUD)</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #64748b;font-size: 0.95rem;line-height: 1.6;margin-bottom: 1.25rem\">\n            Commercial cleaning is calculated based on estimated service duration (minimum 2.0 hours per visit at demo rate of $55.00 AUD/hour). Recurring contracts benefit from scheduled frequency discounts:\n        </p>\n        <div style=\"display: flex;gap: 1rem;flex-wrap: wrap\">\n            <div style=\"background: #ffffff;border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius: 8px;padding: 0.65rem 1.15rem;font-size: 0.92rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a\">\n                Weekly Schedule: Save 15%\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"background: #ffffff;border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius: 8px;padding: 0.65rem 1.15rem;font-size: 0.92rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a\">\n                Fortnightly Schedule: Save 10%\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: center\">\n        <a href=\"http://prime-cleaning-service.local/get-a-quote/\" class=\"pce-btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 0.95rem 2.25rem\">Calculate Commercial Cleaning Estimate &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n','Office Cleaning','','inherit','closed','closed','','11-revision-v1','','','2026-11-07 12:56:18','2026-11-07 12:56:18','',11,'http://prime-cleaning-service.local/?p=37',0,'revision','',0);
